### 5. PRIVACY & LOCAL OPERATION
LocalGravity is designed as a local-first workstation. When operating with local AI models, the Software does not transmit your source code, workspace files, or chat prompts to remote servers. All telemetry and diagnostic features respect the user's configured settings.

